decisions.question:
The imports channel is not a relationship, so every M60 line audit run to date examined exactly ZERO of its records — 4,971 in 717 files. What contract does it owe? Answering that question immediately found a real defect: a multi-line top-level group (`use {
    aho_corasick::AhoCorasick,
    bstr,
};`) gave every one of its rows the range of the whole declaration, so all of them pointed at the `use {` line, which bears none of the paths they name. 56 such records in ripgrep alone.
